n不要改成\"取该工作区最近一条记录\"：同一工作区开着别的会话时，最近一条往往是别人的，这正是旧版的 bug。用斜杠命令（`/comate-session-ids`）加载本 skill 时不产生工具调用，同样不能依赖\"调用 skill 的记录\"。\n\n## 步骤\n\n两步必须是**两次独立的工具调用**，不要用 `&&`、`;` 合成一条，也不要并行。\n\n1. 打时间戳：\n\n   ```bash\n   python3 ~/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py --stamp\n   ```\n\n   输出一个整数，比如 `1792229799425`。\n\n2. 紧接着查询（工作区用绝对路径；Agent 的 cwd 可能是 `/`，不要依赖它）：\n\n   ```bash\n   python3 ~/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py \"<工作区绝对路径>\" --after <上一步的整数>\n   ```\n\n   需要结构化结果时加 `--json`。脚本只读：读 hook 日志，用 `mode=ro` 打开 IDE 状态库，不写任何文件。\n\n3. 按输出回答用户：\n   - `engine sessionUuid`：正常情况下 `hook entry` 在时间戳后几秒内，可直接采信。若出现 `WARNING other sessions logged tool calls in the same window`，说明同一时刻别的会话也在调用工具，把候选列给用户；也可以重做一遍两步，通常就不再冲突。\n   - `sidebar session ID`：取状态为 `generating`（正在运行）且唯一的那条，附带标题方便用户核对。\n   - 一句话说明依据来源（见下文\"数据来源\"）。\n\n## 结果不完整时\n\n- `engine ... NOT FOUND (no PostToolUse entry ... after the stamp)`：hook 可能写得慢，再执行一次第 2 步（不用重新打戳）。还是没有就如实告诉用户，不要改用其他办法猜。\n- `engine ... NOT FOUND (hook log not found)`：本机没有启用这个 hook，告知用户即可。\n- `sidebar session ID: UNDETERMINED`：同时有多个或没有 `generating` 会话。把列出的候选（ID、状态、更新时间、标题）给用户，按标题让用户确认，不要自己挑。\n- `sidebar ... NOT FOUND`，或候选里没有当前会话：这张表只记录 **Spec 模式**会话，普通 Agent 会话通常没有记录。如实说\"未找到 Spec 会话记录\"。普通会话的侧边栏 ID 是否等于引擎 sessionUuid **未经验证**，不要说成同一个值。\n\n## 数据来源（供解释与排错）\n\n| 值 | 位置 | 识别方式 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 引擎 sessionUuid | `~/.comate/builtin-hook-state/notify-dispatcher.log`（JSON 行） | 每次工具调用结束后依次写 `start`（含 `event=PostToolUse`、`conversationId`）、`loadWatch`（含会话 `cwd`）、`record`（含 `toolName`，Bash 为 `run_command`）；按 `cwd` 过滤工作区，按时间对齐第 1 步 |\n| 侧边栏会话 ID | `<IDE 用户目录>/workspaceStorage/<hash>/state.vscdb`，表 `ItemTable`，key `comateAgentEditor.session.<id>` | `<hash>` 目录下 `workspace.json` 的 `folder` 指向当前工作区；value 是 JSON，含 `sessionId`、`title`、`iconStatus`、`updatedAt` |\n\nIDE 用户目录：macOS `~/Library/Application Support/Comate/User`，Linux `~/.config/Comate/User`，Windows `%APPDATA%\\Comate\\User`。\n\n不要把 `User/History/` 或 `chatEditingSessions/` 里出现的 ID 当作依据：那是 IDE 的本地历史和编辑快照，可能来自其他会话写过的文件，原文件删掉后快照依然存在。\n","metadata":{"relativePath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/SKILL.md","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/SKILL.md","resolution":"absolute","skillName":"comate-session-ids","skillPath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids"}}}]},{"id":"6ad613094cf4dd3ab83f0ab1","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":15160},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_0176XMRz17Q2hsTAGYq5x2et","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"python3 ~/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py --stamp","description":"Record timestamp for session lookup","prefix_rule":"[\"python3\",\"~/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py\"]"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\n1792414488408\n","metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/sym-combo-customize","autoRun":true,"state":"completed","runMode":"yolo","taskId":"3vbtsx","output":"1792414488408\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}}]},{"id":"6ad613184cf4dd3ab83f0c14","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":5574},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01GwVeeaisF8guqwsc58BYV5","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"python3 ~/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py \"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/sym-combo-customize\" --after 1792414488408","description":"Query current session IDs","prefix_rule":"[\"python3\",\"~/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py\"]"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\nworkspace: /Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/sym-combo-customize\nengine sessionUuid: b069b19e-996e-4c07-bc76-8ee98441ff63  [hook entry 0.2s after stamp]\nsidebar session ID: UNDETERMINED (generating sessions: 0); candidates:\n","metadata":